#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:22
msgid ""
"Introduced the **Advanced** license tier, expanding the platform to three"
" tiers: VM Essentials, Advanced, and Enterprise. Advanced includes "
"Ansible, Kubernetes (HKS), Workflows, Service Catalog, Personas, and "
"additional automation and integration capabilities. See "
":doc:`feature_matrix` for the complete tier comparison."
msgstr "Se introdujo el nivel de licencia **Advanced**, ampliando la plataforma a tres niveles: VM Essentials, Advanced y Enterprise. Advanced incluye Ansible, Kubernetes (HKS), Workflows, Service Catalog, Personas y capacidades adicionales de automatización e integración. Consulte :doc:`feature_matrix` para la comparación completa de niveles."

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst
msgid "HVM & VM Essentials"
msgstr "HVM y VM Essentials"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:24
msgid ""
"Virtual Switch management: add, edit, and remove virtual switches with "
"advanced port group management and network reconfiguration directly from "
"the UI"
msgstr "Administración de Virtual Switch: agregar, editar y eliminar virtual switches con administración avanzada de port groups y reconfiguración de red directamente desde la UI"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:25
msgid ""
"NVIDIA vGPU slicing: create SR-IOV vGPU profiles on supported HVM Hosts "
"and bind physical GPU types or vGPU Segment Types to Service Plans"
msgstr "Slicing NVIDIA vGPU: crear perfiles SR-IOV vGPU en HVM Hosts compatibles y vincular tipos de GPU físicos o vGPU Segment Types a Service Plans"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:26
msgid ""
"Host Profiles: define and apply standardized host configurations across "
"cluster hosts, similar to VMware vCenter Host Profiles"
msgstr "Host Profiles: definir y aplicar configuraciones estandarizadas de host en hosts del clúster, similares a VMware vCenter Host Profiles"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:27
msgid ""
"Host Configuration Backup & Restore: back up HVM host identity and "
"configuration for faster hardware replacement"
msgstr "Host Configuration Backup & Restore: respaldar la identidad y configuración del host HVM para un reemplazo de hardware más rápido"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:28
msgid ""
"Bulk operations: trigger actions on multiple VMs or hosts simultaneously "
"(migrate, snapshot, power operations, tag, and more)"
msgstr "Operaciones masivas: activar acciones en múltiples VMs o hosts simultáneamente (migrate, snapshot, power operations, tag y más)"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:29
msgid ""
"Increased live migration concurrency during Maintenance Mode to reduce "
"maintenance windows for dense environments"
msgstr "Se aumentó la concurrencia de migración en vivo durante Maintenance Mode para reducir las ventanas de mantenimiento en entornos densos"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:30
msgid ""
"Connect and disconnect virtual network interfaces on running VMs without "
"requiring a full reconfigure, supporting backup recovery and security "
"isolation workflows"
msgstr "Conectar y desconectar interfaces de red virtual en VMs en ejecución sin requerir una reconfiguración completa, lo que admite flujos de recuperación de backup y aislamiento de seguridad"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:31
msgid ""
"Expose advanced VM deployment settings (TPM, Secure Boot, UEFI, Nested "
"Virtualization) in Reconfigure for Day 2 modifications without rebuilding"
msgstr "Exponer configuraciones avanzadas de implementación de VM (TPM, Secure Boot, UEFI, Nested Virtualization) en Reconfigure para modificaciones Day 2 sin reconstruir"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:32
msgid ""
"Centralized Affinity Placement management: view and manage VM affinity "
"rules and pinning overrides from a single cluster-level interface"
msgstr "Administración centralizada de Affinity Placement: ver y administrar reglas de afinidad de VM y anulaciones de pinning desde una única interfaz a nivel de clúster"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:33
msgid ""
"Linked clones: create space-efficient clones that share a base disk image"
" with the parent VM"
msgstr "Linked clones: crear clones eficientes en espacio que comparten una imagen de disco base con la VM principal"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:34
msgid ""
"Datastore Evacuation / Maintenance Mode: automatically migrate VMs off a "
"datastore being retired or replaced"
msgstr "Datastore Evacuation / Maintenance Mode: migrar automáticamente VMs fuera de un almacén de datos que se retira o reemplaza"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:35
msgid ""
"Raw Device Block Mapping (RDBM): attach raw host block devices directly "
"to VMs for performance-sensitive workloads"
msgstr "Raw Device Block Mapping (RDBM): adjuntar dispositivos de bloque raw del host directamente a VMs para cargas de trabajo sensibles al rendimiento"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:36
msgid "Virtual machine console access directly from HVM hosts"
msgstr "Acceso a consola de máquina virtual directamente desde hosts HVM"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:37
msgid "CPU Ready-equivalent metric for monitoring vCPU scheduling contention"
msgstr "Métrica equivalente a CPU Ready para monitorear la contención de programación de vCPU"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:38
msgid ""
"Leverage QEMU Guest Agent to gather guest OS information (IP addresses, "
"OS version, hostname) without network-based access"
msgstr "Aprovechar QEMU Guest Agent para recopilar información del SO invitado (direcciones IP, versión del SO, hostname) sin acceso basado en red"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:39
msgid ""
"VSS-aware application-consistent snapshots: when the QEMU Guest Agent is "
"connected, snapshots trigger Windows Volume Shadow Copy Service for "
"database and application consistency"
msgstr "Snapshots consistentes a nivel de aplicación conscientes de VSS: cuando QEMU Guest Agent está conectado, los snapshots activan Windows Volume Shadow Copy Service para consistencia de bases de datos y aplicaciones"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:40
msgid ""
"vNUMA provisioning: automatic or manual virtual NUMA topology for wide "
"VMs spanning multiple CPU sockets, with Off/Auto/Manual modes"
msgstr "Aprovisionamiento vNUMA: topología NUMA virtual automática o manual para VMs amplias que abarcan múltiples sockets de CPU, con modos Off/Auto/Manual"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:41
msgid ""
"vCPU Placement: cluster-level CPU affinity management with Unmanaged, "
"Region, and Pinned modes for NUMA-aware workload performance"
msgstr "vCPU Placement: administración de afinidad de CPU a nivel de clúster con modos Unmanaged, Region y Pinned para rendimiento de cargas de trabajo con conciencia NUMA"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:42
msgid ""
"Improved audit logging: administrative actions (datastore changes, "
"cluster settings, VM promotions) now recorded in object History for full "
"traceability"
msgstr "Registro de auditoría mejorado: las acciones administrativas (cambios de almacén de datos, configuraciones de clúster, promociones de VM) ahora se registran en el Historial del objeto para trazabilidad completa"

#: ../../release_notes/current.rst:43
msgid ""
"HVM Cluster OS Layout Ubuntu/HVM 26.04 support for confidential compute "
"functions"
msgstr "Soporte de HVM Cluster OS Layout Ubuntu/HVM 26.04 para funciones de confidential compute"

